## Guidelines

1. `start` and `end` are whole seconds, inside the recording, with start before end.
2. Use as many events as the material needs, at most {{ max_events }}, in recording order.
3. `title` is at most 12 words and `summary` at most 40, both in the language of the shots.
4. Group shots that belong to one happening. Do not invent an event the shots do not show, and do not leave a long stretch unassigned.
